{"type":"frame-snapshot","snapshot":{"callId":"call@8112","snapshotName":"after@call@8112","pageId":"page@06145f9785f33f8cad61789f68499a86","frameId":"frame@0f33647fb7a6323797cb1d121e5f915e","frameUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:7483/#/operator-dashboard","doctype":"html","html":["HTML",{"lang":"it"},["HEAD",{},[[5,0]],[[5,1]],[[5,2]],[[5,3]],[[5,4]],[[5,5]],[[5,6]],[[5,7]],[[5,8]],[[5,9]],[[5,10]],[[5,11]],[[5,12]],[[5,13]],[[5,15]],[[5,16]],[[5,18]],[[5,20]],[[5,22]],[[5,24]],[[5,26]],[[5,28]],[[1,1]],[[1,3]],[[1,5]],[[1,7]],[[1,9]],[[1,11]],[[1,13]],["STYLE",{},"/* Scelta \"Nuovo paziente\": due opzioni grandi, documenti (rapido) prima di a mano. */\r\n.new-patient-chooser {\r\n  width: min(520px, 92vw);\r\n  max-width: 520px;\r\n  padding: 24px;\r\n  overflow-y: auto;\r\n}\r\n.new-patient-chooser__head {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: space-between;\r\n  gap: 16px;\r\n}\r\n.new-patient-chooser__title {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  font-size: 18px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.new-patient-chooser__desc {\r\n  margin: 8px 0 16px;\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.new-patient-chooser__options {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  gap: 16px;\r\n}\r\n.new-patient-chooser__option {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: flex-start;\r\n  gap: 16px;\r\n  min-height: 88px;\r\n  padding: 16px;\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 14px;\r\n  background: var(--surface);\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n  text-align: left;\r\n  font: inherit;\r\n  cursor: pointer;\r\n}\r\n.new-patient-chooser__option:hover:not(:disabled) {\r\n  border-color: var(--blue);\r\n}\r\n.new-patient-chooser__option--primary {\r\n  border-color: var(--blue);\r\n  background: var(--blue-bg, #e8f0fe);\r\n}\r\n.new-patient-chooser__option:disabled {\r\n  cursor: not-allowed;\r\n  border-color: var(--border);\r\n  background: var(--surface-raised, #f5f7fa);\r\n}\r\n.new-patient-chooser__option:disabled .new-patient-chooser__icon {\r\n  background: var(--border);\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.new-patient-chooser__option:focus-visible {\r\n  outline: 2px solid var(--blue);\r\n  outline-offset: 2px;\r\n}\r\n.new-patient-chooser__icon {\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: center;\r\n  flex-shrink: 0;\r\n  width: 48px;\r\n  height: 48px;\r\n  border-radius: 12px;\r\n  background: var(--blue);\r\n  color: #fff;\r\n}\r\n.new-patient-chooser__option:not(.new-patient-chooser__option--primary) .new-patient-chooser__icon {\r\n  background: var(--blue-bg, #e8f0fe);\r\n  color: var(--blue);\r\n}\r\n.new-patient-chooser__icon svg {\r\n  width: 24px;\r\n  height: 24px;\r\n}\r\n.new-patient-chooser__text {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  gap: 4px;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n  line-height: 1.45;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.new-patient-chooser__text strong {\r\n  font-size: 16px;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n}\r\n.new-patient-chooser__status {\r\n  font-style: normal;\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n  color: var(--blue);\r\n}\r\n.new-patient-chooser__status--off {\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n}\r\n@media (max-width: 480px) {\r\n  .new-patient-chooser {\r\n    padding: 16px;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"],["STYLE",{},"/* Nuovo ingresso — HMI 1 (artifacts/hmi-parity/proto/ingresso-start.png). Token del design system. */\r\n.nps {\r\n  outline: none;\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: 24px;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n.nps__top {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  justify-content: flex-start;\r\n}\r\n.nps__options {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n  gap: 16px;\r\n}\r\n/* Card di scelta: componente dichiarato del design system (grande superficie cliccabile). */\r\n.nps-option {\r\n  box-sizing: border-box;\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  align-items: flex-start;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n  min-height: 240px;\r\n  padding: 24px;\r\n  border: var(--ds-border-w) solid var(--ds-border);\r\n  border-radius: var(--ds-card-radius);\r\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\r\n  color: var(--ds-text);\r\n  text-align: left;\r\n  cursor: pointer;\r\n  font: inherit;\r\n}\r\n.nps-option:hover:not(:disabled) {\r\n  border-color: var(--ds-blue);\r\n}\r\n.nps-option:focus-visible {\r\n  outline: var(--ds-focus);\r\n  outline-offset: 2px;\r\n}\r\n.nps-option:disabled {\r\n  cursor: not-allowed;\r\n  background: var(--ds-surface-2);\r\n}\r\n/* Disabilitata: attenuati icona e testi, non il motivo (va letto). */\r\n.nps-option:disabled .nps-option__icon,\r\n.nps-option:disabled .nps-option__title,\r\n.nps-option:disabled .nps-option__text {\r\n  opacity: 0.6;\r\n}\r\n.nps-option__icon {\r\n  width: 48px;\r\n  height: 48px;\r\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius);\r\n  background: var(--ds-blue-tint);\r\n  color: var(--ds-blue-active);\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  place-items: center;\r\n}\r\n.nps-option__icon svg {\r\n  width: 24px;\r\n  height: 24px;\r\n}\r\n.nps-option__title {\r\n  font: 600 20px/28px var(--ds-font);\r\n}\r\n.nps-option__text {\r\n  font: 400 16px/24px var(--ds-font);\r\n  color: var(--ds-text);\r\n}\r\n.nps-option__status {\r\n  margin-top: auto;\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 6px;\r\n  padding: 6px 12px;\r\n  border-radius: var(--ds-radius);\r\n  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--purple) 12%, white);\r\n  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--purple) 80%, black);\r\n  font: 600 14px/20px var(--ds-font);\r\n}\r\n.nps-option__status svg {\r\n  width: 16px;\r\n  height: 16px;\r\n}\r\n.nps-option__status--off {\r\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\r\n  color: var(--ds-text);\r\n}\r\n.nps__how {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: 16px;\r\n}\r\n.nps__how h2 {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n}\r\n.nps__how-grid {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n  gap: 24px;\r\n}\r\n.nps__how-title {\r\n  margin: 0 0 4px;\r\n  font: 600 16px/24px var(--ds-font);\r\n  color: var(--ds-text);\r\n}\r\n.nps__how-text {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  font: 400 16px/24px var(--ds-font);\r\n  color: var(--ds-text);\r\n}\r\n@media (max-width: 1023px) {\r\n  .nps__options,\r\n  .nps__how-grid {\r\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);\r\n  }\r\n  .nps-option {\r\n    min-height: 0;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"],["STYLE",{},".patient-identity {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  gap: 3px;\r\n  text-align: left;\r\n  line-height: 1.4;\r\n  white-space: normal;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n}\r\n.patient-identity .patient-identity__name,\r\n.patient-identity__name {\r\n  color: var(--text, #1a3357);\r\n  font-size: 15px;\r\n  font-weight: 750;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n  white-space: normal;\r\n}\r\n.patient-identity__identifier {\r\n  color: var(--text, #1a3357);\r\n  font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n  white-space: normal;\r\n}\r\n.patient-identity .patient-identity__location {\r\n  color: var(--text, #1a3357);\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n  font-weight: 550;\r\n}\r\n.patient-identity .patient-identity__context,\r\n.patient-identity .patient-identity__incomplete {\r\n  color: var(--text-muted, #526174);\r\n  font-size: 11px;\r\n  font-weight: 400;\r\n}\r\n.consegna-card__patient > .patient-identity {\r\n  flex: 1;\r\n}\r\n.consegna-card__patient {\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n}\r\n.consegna-card__patient > .consegna-paziente {\r\n  min-height: 44px;\r\n  white-space: normal;\r\n}\r\n.consegna-card__patient > .consegna-paziente:focus-visible {\r\n  outline: 2px solid var(--blue, #2463eb);\r\n  outline-offset: 3px;\r\n}\r\n"],["STYLE",{},".reading-recency {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  gap: 2px;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  max-width: 100%;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n  font-weight: 500;\r\n  line-height: 1.5;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n  white-space: normal;\r\n}\r\n.vt__trend.vt__comparison {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  align-items: start;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n}\r\n"],["STYLE",{},"/* NEWS2: il badge (testata, lista, turno, storico) è il ds-badge canonico di design-system.css;\r\n   qui il contenitore (lista, turno) e lo storico. Rosso solo per rischio clinico (medio/alto). */\r\n\r\n/* contenitore del badge: resta cliccabile sopra il collegamento della card del turno; nella\r\n   colonna della lista si accorcia (…) invece di uscire dalla cella */\r\n.turno-pcard__news2 {\r\n  position: relative;\r\n  z-index: 1;\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  max-width: 100%;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n.turno-pcard__news2:empty {\r\n  display: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.modal-box.news2-dialog,\r\n.news2-dialog {\r\n  /* La tabella ha nove colonne: più larga della finestra standard. */\r\n  max-width: none;\r\n  width: min(960px, calc(100vw - 32px));\r\n  padding: 20px 24px;\r\n  box-sizing: border-box;\r\n  max-height: calc(100vh - 48px);\r\n  overflow: auto;\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: 14px;\r\n}\r\n.news2-dialog__head {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: flex-start;\r\n  justify-content: space-between;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n}\r\n.news2-dialog__title {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  font-size: 20px;\r\n}\r\n.news2-dialog__sub {\r\n  margin: 2px 0 0;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.news2-dialog__now {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  padding: 10px 12px;\r\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\r\n  background: var(--surface-raised);\r\n}\r\n.news2-dialog__now--medium,\r\n.news2-dialog__now--high {\r\n  background: var(--red-bg);\r\n  color: var(--red);\r\n}\r\n.news2-dialog__now--single {\r\n  background: var(--amber-bg);\r\n  color: var(--amber);\r\n}\r\n.news2-dialog__now--ok {\r\n  background: var(--emerald-bg);\r\n  color: var(--emerald);\r\n}\r\n.news2-dialog__stale {\r\n  display: block;\r\n  margin-top: 6px;\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n}\r\n.news2-dialog__error {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  padding: 12px;\r\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  background: var(--surface-raised);\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: 8px;\r\n  align-items: flex-start;\r\n}\r\n.news2-dialog__error p {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n}\r\n.news2-dialog__note,\r\n.news2-dialog__empty {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  font-size: 12.5px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.news2-chart {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n}\r\n.news2-chart svg {\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n  height: auto;\r\n  display: block;\r\n}\r\n.news2-chart__band--ok {\r\n  fill: var(--emerald-bg);\r\n}\r\n.news2-chart__band--low {\r\n  fill: var(--surface-raised);\r\n}\r\n.news2-chart__band--medium {\r\n  fill: var(--red-bg);\r\n  fill-opacity: 0.55;\r\n}\r\n.news2-chart__band--high {\r\n  fill: var(--red-bg);\r\n}\r\n.news2-chart__line {\r\n  stroke: var(--text-muted);\r\n  stroke-width: 2;\r\n}\r\n.news2-chart__dot {\r\n  fill: var(--blue);\r\n  stroke: var(--surface);\r\n  stroke-width: 2;\r\n}\r\n.news2-chart__dot--ok {\r\n  fill: var(--emerald);\r\n}\r\n.news2-chart__dot--single {\r\n  fill: var(--amber);\r\n}\r\n.news2-chart__dot--medium,\r\n.news2-chart__dot--high {\r\n  fill: var(--red);\r\n}\r\n.news2-chart__axis {\r\n  fill: var(--text-muted);\r\n  font-size: 11px;\r\n  font-family: var(--font-ui);\r\n}\r\n.news2-chart__legend {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.news2-chart__key::before {\r\n  content: '';\r\n  display: inline-block;\r\n  width: 10px;\r\n  height: 10px;\r\n  margin-right: 6px;\r\n  border-radius: 3px;\r\n  vertical-align: -1px;\r\n}\r\n.news2-chart__key--low::before {\r\n  background: var(--surface-raised);\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n}\r\n.news2-chart__key--medium::before {\r\n  background: var(--red-bg);\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--red-border);\r\n}\r\n.news2-chart__key--high::before {\r\n  background: var(--red-bg);\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--red);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.news2-table-wrap {\r\n  overflow-x: auto;\r\n}\r\n.news2-table {\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n  border-collapse: collapse;\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\r\n}\r\n.news2-table th,\r\n.news2-table td {\r\n  padding: 8px 8px;\r\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  text-align: left;\r\n  vertical-align: middle;\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.news2-table thead th {\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n}\r\n.news2-table tbody th small {\r\n  display: block;\r\n  font-weight: 400;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.news2-table__row--incomplete td,\r\n.news2-table__row--incomplete th {\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.news2-table__missing {\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n  white-space: normal;\r\n}\r\n.news2-part {\r\n  margin-left: 4px;\r\n  padding: 0 5px;\r\n  border-radius: 6px;\r\n  font-size: 11px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n}\r\n/* Sotto-punteggi: +1/+2 neutri, +3 in ambra (singolo parametro critico). Il rosso resta al\r\n   totale ≥ 5. */\r\n.news2-part--mid {\r\n  background: var(--surface-raised);\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.news2-part--high {\r\n  background: var(--amber-bg);\r\n  color: var(--amber);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ── Panoramica (HMI 1): tessere dei parametri e del NEWS2, come il prototipo ── */\r\n.vitals {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n  grid-auto-rows: 1fr;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n  align-items: stretch;\r\n}\r\n.vt {\r\n  background: var(--surface);\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 12px;\r\n  padding: 12px;\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  align-items: flex-start;\r\n  gap: 4px;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n  text-align: left;\r\n  font: inherit;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n}\r\n.vt--warn {\r\n  background: #fdf3e2;\r\n  border-color: transparent;\r\n}\r\n.vt--crit {\r\n  background: #fdecee;\r\n  border-color: transparent;\r\n}\r\n.vt__label {\r\n  font: 500 14px/20px var(--font-ui);\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.vt__value {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: baseline;\r\n  gap: 4px;\r\n  font: 600 22px/28px var(--font-ui);\r\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n}\r\n.vt__value small {\r\n  font: 500 14px/20px var(--font-ui);\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.vt--warn .vt__value {\r\n  color: #8f5500;\r\n}\r\n.vt--crit .vt__value {\r\n  color: #b42335;\r\n}\r\n.vt__value--muted {\r\n  font: 600 20px/28px var(--font-ui);\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.vt__trend {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 4px;\r\n  font: 500 14px/20px var(--font-ui);\r\n  min-height: 20px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.vt__trend svg {\r\n  width: 16px;\r\n  height: 16px;\r\n  flex: none;\r\n  fill: none;\r\n  stroke: currentColor;\r\n  stroke-width: 2;\r\n  stroke-linecap: round;\r\n  stroke-linejoin: round;\r\n}\r\n.vt--news2 {\r\n  cursor: pointer;\r\n}\r\n.vt--news2:hover {\r\n  border-color: var(--blue);\r\n}\r\n.vt--news2:focus-visible {\r\n  outline: 3px solid #245bb5;\r\n  outline-offset: 2px;\r\n}\r\n.vitals-note {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  font: 500 14px/20px var(--font-ui);\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.vitals-note--error {\r\n  color: #b42335;\r\n}\r\n@media (max-width: 1100px) {\r\n  .vitals {\r\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n@media (max-width: 560px) {\r\n  .vitals {\r\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ── UX direct-access (2026-10-03) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n   Tessera NEWS2: la parte superiore apre lo storico, «Rileva ora» (F10) apre l'inserimento dei\r\n   parametri; «Non calcolabile» va a capo invece di essere tagliato. */\r\n.vt--news2 {\r\n  cursor: default;\r\n}\r\n.vt--news2:hover {\r\n  border-color: var(--border);\r\n}\r\n.vt--news2.vt--warn:hover,\r\n.vt--news2.vt--crit:hover {\r\n  border-color: transparent;\r\n}\r\n.vt__open {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  align-items: flex-start;\r\n  gap: 4px;\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n  border: 0;\r\n  background: none;\r\n  font: inherit;\r\n  color: inherit;\r\n  text-align: left;\r\n  cursor: pointer;\r\n}\r\n.vt__open:hover .vt__label {\r\n  color: var(--blue);\r\n}\r\n.vt__open:focus-visible {\r\n  outline: 3px solid #245bb5;\r\n  outline-offset: 4px;\r\n  border-radius: 8px;\r\n}\r\n.vt--news2 .vt__value--muted {\r\n  white-space: normal;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n}\r\n.vt--news2 .vt__trend {\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n}\r\n.vt__record {\r\n  margin-top: 8px;\r\n  min-height: 44px;\r\n  align-self: stretch;\r\n  justify-content: center;\r\n}\r\n/* Chip compatto (colonne strette): ora e «da aggiornare» in chiaro, il testo va a capo. */\r\n.news2-chip--compact {\r\n  white-space: normal;\r\n  height: auto;\r\n  min-height: 28px;\r\n  text-align: left;\r\n}\r\n.news2-chip--compact .ds-badge__text {\r\n  white-space: normal;\r\n  overflow: visible;\r\n  text-overflow: clip;\r\n}\r\n.vitals-summary {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n}\r\n.vitals-summary__head {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  justify-content: space-between;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n}\r\n.vitals-summary__head h2 {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  font: 600 16px/24px var(--font-ui);\r\n}\r\n.vitals-summary__actions {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n}\r\n.vitals-summary__status {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n  line-height: 1.5;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.vitals-summary__status--crit {\r\n  color: #b42335;\r\n}\r\n.vitals-summary__status--warn {\r\n  color: #8f5500;\r\n}\r\n.vitals-dialog {\r\n  padding: 24px;\r\n  width: min(900px, calc(100vw - 32px));\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  gap: 20px;\r\n  overflow-y: auto;\r\n}\r\n.vitals--expanded {\r\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n}\r\n.vitals--expanded .vt {\r\n  padding: 20px;\r\n}\r\n.vitals--expanded .vt__value {\r\n  font-size: 28px;\r\n  line-height: 36px;\r\n}\r\n@media (max-width: 560px) {\r\n  .vitals--expanded {\r\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n  }\r\n  .vitals-dialog {\r\n    padding: 16px;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"],["STYLE",{},".plist-regime-controls {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  gap: 12px 20px;\r\n  padding: 12px 16px;\r\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n}\r\n.plist-regime-field {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: 4px;\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n  flex: 0 1 220px;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n.plist-regime-field .form-input { width: 100%; }\r\n.plist-regime-summary {\r\n  flex: 1 1 280px;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  align-self: center;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n}\r\n.plist-regime-summary p { margin: 3px 0; }\r\n@media (max-width: 680px) {\r\n  .plist-regime-field, .plist-regime-summary { flex-basis: 100%; }\r\n}\r\n"],["STYLE",{},".roster-order {\r\n  margin-block: 12px;\r\n  padding: 12px 16px;\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 10px;\r\n  background: var(--surface);\r\n}\r\n.roster-order__controls {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  align-items: end;\r\n  gap: 10px;\r\n}\r\n.roster-order label {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  gap: 4px;\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n}\r\n.roster-order select,\r\n.roster-order button {\r\n  min-height: 44px;\r\n}\r\n.roster-order button {\r\n  white-space: normal;\r\n}\r\n.roster-order button:focus-visible,\r\n.roster-order select:focus-visible {\r\n  outline: 2px solid var(--blue);\r\n  outline-offset: 2px;\r\n}\r\n.roster-order__status {\r\n  margin: 8px 0 0;\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n}\r\n.roster-order__error {\r\n  margin-top: 8px;\r\n  color: var(--red);\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n}\r\n.roster-defaults {\r\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\r\n}\r\n.roster-defaults summary {\r\n  cursor: pointer;\r\n  min-height: 44px;\r\n  padding-block: 12px;\r\n}\r\n.roster-defaults__row {\r\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  padding-block: 12px;\r\n}\r\n.roster-defaults__row h4 {\r\n  margin: 0 0 8px;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n}\r\n@media (max-width: 520px) {\r\n  .roster-order__controls > label {\r\n    flex: 1 1 140px;\r\n  }\r\n  .roster-order {\r\n    padding: 10px;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"],["STYLE",{},".patient-roster-wrap {\r\n  overflow: hidden;\r\n  background: var(--surface);\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: var(--operational-table-radius);\r\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster-status {\r\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n  padding: 9px 12px;\r\n  color: var(--blue);\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n  font-weight: 650;\r\n  background: var(--indigo-bg);\r\n  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 22%, var(--border));\r\n  border-radius: 10px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster-status--warning {\r\n  color: var(--amber-dark, #8a5700);\r\n  background: var(--amber-bg);\r\n  border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--amber) 35%, var(--border));\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster {\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n  border-collapse: collapse;\r\n  table-layout: fixed;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster > caption.sr-only {\r\n  position: absolute;\r\n  width: 1px;\r\n  height: 1px;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n  margin: -1px;\r\n  overflow: hidden;\r\n  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n  border: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster th {\r\n  height: var(--operational-table-header-h);\r\n  padding: 0 var(--operational-table-cell-px);\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  background: var(--surface-raised);\r\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  font-size: var(--operational-table-header-fs);\r\n  font-weight: 750;\r\n  letter-spacing: 0.35px;\r\n  text-align: left;\r\n  text-transform: uppercase;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster th:nth-child(1) {\r\n  width: 25%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* intestazione ordinabile: ds-sort canonico (design-system.css) */\r\n.patient-roster-order {\r\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n}\r\n.patient-roster-order__status {\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n}\r\n.patient-roster-order__mobile {\r\n  display: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster th:nth-child(2) {\r\n  width: 19%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster th:nth-child(3) {\r\n  width: 15%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster th:nth-child(4) {\r\n  width: auto;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster th:nth-child(5) {\r\n  width: 116px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster td {\r\n  min-height: var(--operational-table-row-min-h);\r\n  padding: 12px var(--operational-table-cell-px);\r\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);\r\n  vertical-align: middle;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster tbody tr:last-child td {\r\n  border-bottom: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster tbody tr {\r\n  cursor: pointer;\r\n  transition: background 0.14s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster tbody tr:hover {\r\n  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 4%, var(--surface));\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster tbody tr:focus-visible {\r\n  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 8%, var(--surface));\r\n  outline: 2px solid var(--blue);\r\n  outline-offset: -2px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster tbody tr:active {\r\n  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 11%, var(--surface));\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster tbody tr:has(.patient-roster__empty) {\r\n  cursor: default;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster__identity {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 11px;\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n  min-height: 44px;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n  font: inherit;\r\n  text-align: left;\r\n  background: transparent;\r\n  border: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster__identity > span:last-child {\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster__identity strong,\r\n.patient-roster__identity small {\r\n  display: block;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster__identity strong {\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n  font-weight: 750;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n  white-space: normal;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster__identity small {\r\n  margin-top: 4px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  font-size: 11.5px;\r\n  font-weight: 500;\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster__avatar,\r\n.patient-card__avatar {\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  flex: 0 0 40px;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: center;\r\n  width: 40px;\r\n  height: 40px;\r\n  color: var(--blue);\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n  font-weight: 800;\r\n  background: var(--indigo-bg);\r\n  border-radius: 11px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-fiscal-code {\r\n  display: inline-block;\r\n  max-width: 100%;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n  font-weight: 650;\r\n  letter-spacing: 0.25px;\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-fiscal-code--missing {\r\n  color: var(--amber-dark, #8a5700);\r\n  font-family: var(--font-ui);\r\n  font-size: 11.5px;\r\n  font-weight: 650;\r\n  white-space: normal;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-signals {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  gap: 5px;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-signals .alert-chip,\r\n.patient-signals .indicatore-anomalie,\r\n.patient-signal {\r\n  min-height: 24px;\r\n  padding: 3px 8px;\r\n  font-size: 10.5px;\r\n  line-height: 1.15;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-signal {\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  color: var(--blue);\r\n  font-weight: 750;\r\n  background: var(--indigo-bg);\r\n  border-radius: 999px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-signal--warning {\r\n  color: var(--amber-dark, #8a5700);\r\n  background: var(--amber-bg);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-signals__empty {\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  font-size: 11.5px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster__action-heading,\r\n.patient-roster__actions {\r\n  text-align: right !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-roster__actions {\r\n  padding-inline: 8px !important;\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* apri/elimina: ds-icon-btn canonici (design-system.css) */\r\n\r\n.patient-roster__empty {\r\n  height: 88px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  text-align: center;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.patient-card-grid {\r\n  display: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (max-width: 1023px) {\r\n  .patient-list-view .toolbar .filter-chips {\r\n    max-width: 100%;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .patient-list-view .toolbar .search-wrap {\r\n    flex-basis: 100%;\r\n    max-width: none;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .patient-roster-order__mobile {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n    gap: 8px;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .patient-roster-order__mobile label {\r\n    font-size: 12px;\r\n    color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  }\r\n  .patient-roster-order__mobile select {\r\n    flex: 1;\r\n    min-width: 125px;\r\n    width: auto;\r\n    min-height: 44px;\r\n  }\r\n  .patient-roster-order__mobile button {\r\n    min-height: 44px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .patient-roster-wrap {\r\n    display: none;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .patient-card-grid {\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n    gap: 10px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .patient-card-grid__state {\r\n    grid-column: 1 / -1;\r\n    min-height: 88px;\r\n    padding: 32px 20px;\r\n    color: var(--text-muted);\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n    background: var(--surface);\r\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n    border-radius: 12px;\r\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .patient-card {\r\n    min-width: 0;\r\n    padding: 14px;\r\n    background: var(--surface);\r\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n    border-radius: 12px;\r\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .patient-card__head {\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: 40px minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\r\n    gap: 10px;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .patient-card__identity {\r\n    min-width: 0;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .patient-card__identity strong,\r\n  .patient-card__identity span {\r\n    display: block;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .patient-card__identity strong {\r\n    color: var(--text);\r\n    font-size: 14px;\r\n    overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n    white-space: normal;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .patient-card__identity span {\r\n    margin-top: 3px;\r\n    color: var(--text-muted);\r\n    font-size: 11px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .patient-card__fiscal {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n    align-items: baseline;\r\n    justify-content: space-between;\r\n    gap: 5px 12px;\r\n    margin-top: 13px;\r\n    padding: 10px 0;\r\n    border-block: 1px solid var(--divider);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .patient-card__fiscal > span:first-child {\r\n    color: var(--text-muted);\r\n    font-size: 11px;\r\n    font-weight: 650;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .patient-card__context {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n    gap: 8px;\r\n    align-items: center;\r\n    margin-top: 11px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .patient-card__delete {\r\n    margin-top: 9px;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (max-width: 680px) {\r\n  .patient-card-grid {\r\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ═══ HMI 1 · lista pazienti come il prototipo ═════════════════════════════\r\n   Card bianche raggio 16 padding 24; controlli 48 (bordo 2, raggio 12); righe ≥ 72 con il\r\n   riquadro 48 della camera; intestazioni in didascalia grigia 14/500, non maiuscole. */\r\n.patient-list-view {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: 24px;\r\n}\r\n.plist-card {\r\n  background: var(--surface);\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 16px;\r\n  padding: 24px;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n.plist-new {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 16px;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n}\r\n.plist-new__ico {\r\n  width: 48px;\r\n  height: 48px;\r\n  flex: none;\r\n  border-radius: 12px;\r\n  background: var(--blue);\r\n  color: #fff;\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  place-items: center;\r\n}\r\n.plist-new__ico svg {\r\n  width: 24px;\r\n  height: 24px;\r\n  fill: none;\r\n  stroke: currentColor;\r\n  stroke-width: 2;\r\n  stroke-linecap: round;\r\n  stroke-linejoin: round;\r\n}\r\n.plist-new__text {\r\n  flex: 1 1 280px;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n.plist-new__text h2 {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  font: 600 20px/28px var(--font-ui);\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n}\r\n.plist-new__text p {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  font: 500 14px/20px var(--font-ui);\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.plist-new__actions {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 8px;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.plist-new .ai-import-btn {\r\n  height: 48px;\r\n  border-radius: 12px;\r\n  font: 600 16px/24px var(--font-ui);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.plist-list {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: 16px;\r\n}\r\n.plist-toolbar {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 16px;\r\n}\r\n.plist-search {\r\n  flex: 1 1 280px;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  max-width: none;\r\n}\r\n.plist-search .search-input {\r\n  height: 48px;\r\n  border-radius: 12px;\r\n  border: 2px solid #b9c4d4;\r\n  background: #f5f7fb;\r\n  font: 400 16px/24px var(--font-ui);\r\n}\r\n.plist-search .search-input:focus {\r\n  border-color: var(--blue);\r\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #eaf1fe;\r\n  outline: none;\r\n}\r\n.plist-views {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  gap: 8px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.plist-filters {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: 16px;\r\n  padding: 16px;\r\n  border-radius: 12px;\r\n  background: #f5f7fb;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* tabella senza cornice propria: vive dentro la card */\r\n.plist-list .patient-roster-wrap {\r\n  border: 0;\r\n  border-radius: 0;\r\n  box-shadow: none;\r\n}\r\n.plist-list .patient-roster th {\r\n  height: 40px;\r\n  padding: 0 16px;\r\n  background: transparent;\r\n  font: 500 14px/20px var(--font-ui);\r\n  letter-spacing: 0;\r\n  text-transform: none;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.plist-list .patient-roster th:nth-child(1) {\r\n  width: 36%;\r\n}\r\n.plist-list .patient-roster th:nth-child(2) {\r\n  width: 15%;\r\n}\r\n.plist-list .patient-roster th:nth-child(3) {\r\n  width: 15%;\r\n}\r\n.plist-list .patient-roster td {\r\n  height: 72px;\r\n  padding: 8px 16px;\r\n  border-bottom: 0;\r\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n}\r\n.patient-roster__bed {\r\n  width: 48px;\r\n  height: 48px;\r\n  flex: none;\r\n  border-radius: 12px;\r\n  background: #f5f7fb;\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  place-items: center;\r\n  font: 600 18px/24px var(--font-ui);\r\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n}\r\n.patient-roster__who {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n.patient-roster__who .patient-identity__name {\r\n  font: 600 16px/24px var(--font-ui);\r\n}\r\n.patient-roster__meta {\r\n  font: 500 14px/20px var(--font-ui);\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\r\n}\r\n.patient-roster__meta .patient-identity__identifier {\r\n  font: inherit;\r\n  color: inherit;\r\n}\r\n/* la camera è nel riquadro e il letto accanto all'età: la riga \"Camera · Letto\" non si ripete */\r\n/* la riga \"Camera · Letto\" non si ripete; la provenienza e la data del posto letto restano */\r\n.plist-list .patient-roster__who .patient-identity__location {\r\n  display: none;\r\n}\r\n.plist-list .patient-roster__who .patient-identity__context {\r\n  font: 500 12px/16px var(--font-ui);\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.plist-sr {\r\n  position: absolute;\r\n  width: 1px;\r\n  height: 1px;\r\n  margin: -1px;\r\n  overflow: hidden;\r\n  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n/* ricovero e segnalazioni come i badge del prototipo: 32 px, raggio 8, 14/500 */\r\n.plist-list .stato-pill,\r\n.plist-list .patient-signal,\r\n.plist-list .patient-signals .alert-chip,\r\n.plist-list .patient-signals .indicatore-anomalie {\r\n  height: 32px;\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  padding: 0 8px;\r\n  border-radius: 8px;\r\n  border: 0;\r\n  font: 500 14px/20px var(--font-ui);\r\n  letter-spacing: 0;\r\n  text-transform: none;\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.plist-list .patient-roster th:nth-child(1) {\r\n  width: 40%;\r\n}\r\n.patient-roster__meta {\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n  overflow: hidden;\r\n  text-overflow: ellipsis;\r\n}\r\n/* Con \"Filtri e ordine\" aperto il selettore dell'ordinamento è visibile a tutte le larghezze:\r\n   permette di ordinare anche per le colonne che non hanno un'intestazione (codice fiscale). */\r\n.plist-list:has(.plist-filters) .patient-roster-order__mobile {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  gap: 8px;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* colonne: più spazio alle segnalazioni, così i badge stanno su una riga e la riga resta bassa */\r\n.plist-list .patient-roster th:nth-child(1) {\r\n  width: 32%;\r\n}\r\n.plist-list .patient-roster th:nth-child(2) {\r\n  width: 13%;\r\n}\r\n/* NEWS2: il badge con punteggio e ora (\"NEWS2 10 · 19:29\") sta nella colonna */\r\n.plist-list .patient-roster th:nth-child(3) {\r\n  width: 17%;\r\n}\r\n/* azioni: un pulsante icona da 48px, due se l'eliminazione di test è attiva */\r\n.plist-list .patient-roster th:nth-child(5) {\r\n  width: 80px;\r\n}\r\n.plist-list .patient-roster:has(.patient-roster__delete) th:nth-child(5) {\r\n  width: 136px;\r\n}\r\n.plist-list .patient-signals {\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  gap: 4px;\r\n}\r\n.plist-search {\r\n  flex: 2 1 400px;\r\n}\r\n.plist-note {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  font: 500 14px/20px var(--font-ui);\r\n  color: #8f5500;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ricerca e viste sulla stessa riga, come il prototipo */\r\n.plist-search {\r\n  flex: 1 1 320px;\r\n}\r\n.plist-list .patient-roster__meta {\r\n  display: block;\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n  overflow: hidden;\r\n  text-overflow: ellipsis;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Direct access: ogni segnalazione della riga è un link alla parte della cartella che la spiega. */\r\n.patient-signal-link {\r\n  border: 0;\r\n  font-family: inherit;\r\n  cursor: pointer;\r\n  white-space: normal;\r\n  text-align: left;\r\n}\r\n.patient-signal-link:hover,\r\n.patient-signal-link:focus-visible {\r\n  text-decoration: underline;\r\n  text-underline-offset: 2px;\r\n}\r\n.patient-signal-link:focus-visible {\r\n  outline: 3px solid var(--blue);\r\n  outline-offset: 2px;\r\n}\r\n.patient-signals .indicatore-anomalie.patient-signal--anomalie {\r\n  white-space: normal;\r\n  border-style: solid;\r\n}\r\n.plist-list .patient-signals .patient-signal--anomalie {\r\n  height: auto;\r\n  min-height: 32px;\r\n}\r\n"],["STYLE",{},".demographics-status {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  gap: 0.25rem 0.5rem;\r\n  align-items: baseline;\r\n  margin: 0.75rem 0;\r\n  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border, #d4dce4);\r\n  border-radius: 0.5rem;\r\n  background: var(--bg-subtle, #f5f7fa);\r\n  font-size: 0.875rem;\r\n}\r\n.demographics-status ul {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  gap: 0.25rem 0.75rem;\r\n  list-style: none;\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n}\r\n.demographics-status button {\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  min-height: 44px;\r\n  min-width: 44px;\r\n  border: 0;\r\n  background: none;\r\n  color: var(--accent, #245a91);\r\n  padding: 0.25rem;\r\n  font: inherit;\r\n  text-decoration: underline;\r\n  cursor: pointer;\r\n}\r\n.demographics-status button:focus-visible {\r\n  outline: 2px solid currentColor;\r\n  outline-offset: 3px;\r\n}\r\n"],["STYLE",{},".clinical-note-editor {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  gap: 14px;\r\n  margin-top: 16px;\r\n}\r\n.clinical-note-editor label {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  gap: 6px;\r\n  color: var(--text, #17263b);\r\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n  font-weight: 500;\r\n}\r\n.clinical-note-editor .form-hint {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n}\r\n.clinical-note-editor textarea:not(#ds) {\r\n  resize: vertical;\r\n  min-height: 160px;\r\n  padding: 12px;\r\n  line-height: 1.6;\r\n  background: #fff;\r\n}\r\n.clinical-note-editor__options {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 200px), 1fr));\r\n  gap: 14px;\r\n}\r\n.clinical-note-editor__options > div {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  gap: 6px;\r\n}\r\n.clinical-note-editor__content {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  gap: 6px;\r\n}\r\n.clinical-note-editor__options select {\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n.diario-history-filters {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: end;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  gap: 10px;\r\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n}\r\n.diario-history-filters label {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  gap: 4px;\r\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\r\n}\r\n.diario-history-filters input {\r\n  max-width: 170px;\r\n}\r\n.am-support-note {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  padding: 8px 20px;\r\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\r\n  background: var(--info-light, #edf3ff);\r\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\r\n}\r\n"],["STYLE",{},".handover-workspace {\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n.handover-workspace :is(button, input, select) {\r\n  min-height: var(--ds-control-h);\r\n}\r\n.handover-workspace :is(button, input, select, textarea, a):focus-visible {\r\n  outline: 2px solid var(--blue);\r\n  outline-offset: 3px;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__layout {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  grid-template-columns: 272px minmax(0, 1fr);\r\n  gap: 24px;\r\n  align-items: start;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__list,\r\n.handover-rounds__filters {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__filters label {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  gap: 5px;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__filters input {\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n  background: #fff;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__list > .ds-link {\r\n  justify-self: start;\r\n}\r\n.ho-eyebrow {\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n  letter-spacing: 0.06em;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  text-transform: uppercase;\r\n}\r\n.ho-label {\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__roster {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  gap: 5px;\r\n  list-style: none;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__patient {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 8px;\r\n  background: var(--surface, #fff);\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__patient.is-selected {\r\n  border-color: var(--blue);\r\n  background: #edf3ff;\r\n  box-shadow: inset 3px 0 var(--blue);\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__select {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  gap: 6px;\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  text-align: left;\r\n  border: 0;\r\n  border-radius: 8px;\r\n  background: transparent;\r\n  padding: 6px;\r\n  cursor: pointer;\r\n  color: inherit;\r\n}\r\n.ho-bed {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  place-items: center;\r\n  flex: 0 0 28px;\r\n  height: 28px;\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 7px;\r\n  background: #f5f8fc;\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n}\r\n.ho-who {\r\n  flex: 1;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__patient .patient-identity {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: 1px;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__patient .patient-identity__name {\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n  line-height: 18px;\r\n  white-space: normal;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__patient\r\n  :is(.patient-identity__identifier, .patient-identity__location, .patient-identity__context) {\r\n  font-size: 11px;\r\n  line-height: 1.4;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__patient > .handover-rounds__diary:not(#ds) {\r\n  --ds-icon-size: 16px;\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  justify-content: center;\r\n  margin: 0 8px 0 0;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  width: 32px;\r\n  min-width: 32px;\r\n  height: 32px;\r\n  min-height: 32px;\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 7px;\r\n  color: var(--blue);\r\n  background: var(--surface, #fff);\r\n  text-decoration: none;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__diary svg {\r\n  width: 16px;\r\n  height: 16px;\r\n}\r\n@media (pointer: coarse) {\r\n  .handover-rounds__patient > .handover-rounds__diary:not(#ds) {\r\n    width: 40px;\r\n    min-width: 40px;\r\n    height: 40px;\r\n    min-height: 40px;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__badges {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  gap: 6px;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  font-size: 11px;\r\n  margin-top: 5px;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__badges:empty {\r\n  display: none;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__badges > span,\r\n.handover-rounds__draft-chip {\r\n  background: #fff1d9;\r\n  color: #815105;\r\n  border-radius: 6px;\r\n  padding: 2px 6px;\r\n  font-size: 11px;\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__detail {\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__patient-heading {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: space-between;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n  background: #fff;\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 14px 14px 0 0;\r\n  padding: 18px 20px;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__patient-heading .patient-identity {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n  gap: 4px;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__patient-heading .patient-identity .patient-identity__name {\r\n  font-size: 20px;\r\n  line-height: 1.35;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__patient-heading :is(.patient-identity__identifier, .patient-identity__location) {\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__patient-heading > a:not(#ds) {\r\n  flex: 0 0 auto;\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__tabs {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  gap: 8px;\r\n  padding: 0 16px;\r\n  margin-bottom: 18px;\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-top: 0;\r\n  border-radius: 0 0 14px 14px;\r\n  background: #fff;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__tabs button {\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 8px;\r\n  padding: 12px 8px;\r\n  border: 0;\r\n  border-bottom: 3px solid transparent;\r\n  border-radius: 0;\r\n  background: transparent;\r\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n  cursor: pointer;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__tabs button[aria-selected='true'] {\r\n  color: var(--blue);\r\n  border-bottom-color: var(--blue);\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__history > .cr-tab-content {\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n  overflow: visible;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__history .cts {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  box-shadow: none;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__history .cts__header {\r\n  padding: 12px 16px;\r\n  background: #fff;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__history .cts__title {\r\n  font-size: 15px;\r\n  letter-spacing: 0;\r\n  text-transform: none;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__history .cts__body {\r\n  padding: 16px;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__history .diario-history-filters {\r\n  padding: 12px;\r\n  background: #f7f9fc;\r\n  border-radius: 10px;\r\n  gap: 10px;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__history .diario-history-filters input {\r\n  background: #fff;\r\n  min-height: var(--ds-control-h);\r\n  font-size: var(--ds-field-font);\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__history .diario-history-filters button:not(#ds) {\r\n  min-height: var(--ds-control-h);\r\n  padding: 0 var(--ds-control-px);\r\n  font-size: var(--ds-control-font);\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__history .diario-cards {\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n  margin-top: 14px;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__history .diario-card {\r\n  background: #fff;\r\n  padding: 16px;\r\n  border-radius: 10px;\r\n  border-left-width: 3px;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__history .diario-card__head {\r\n  gap: 6px;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__history .diario-card__author {\r\n  margin: 10px 0 4px;\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n  font-weight: 500;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__history .diario-card__title {\r\n  font-size: 15px;\r\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__history .diario-card__content {\r\n  color: var(--text, #17263b);\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n  line-height: 1.65;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__history .diario-card__time {\r\n  font-size: 11px;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__composer {\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 14px;\r\n  background: #fff;\r\n  padding: 20px;\r\n}\r\n.ho-card-head {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: space-between;\r\n  gap: 8px;\r\n}\r\n.ho-card-head h3 {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  font-size: 18px;\r\n}\r\n.ho-cap {\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__composer-identity {\r\n  padding-block: 12px;\r\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__composer .clinical-note-editor select {\r\n  background: #fff;\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__actions {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  justify-content: flex-end;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 10px;\r\n  margin-top: 20px;\r\n  padding-top: 16px;\r\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__actions button:not(#ds) {\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n  padding: 10px 14px;\r\n}\r\n.handover-rounds__actions .link-btn {\r\n  margin-right: auto;\r\n}\r\n.handover-workspace__memory {\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  margin-top: 16px;\r\n}\r\n.ho-sr {\r\n  position: absolute;\r\n  width: 1px;\r\n  height: 1px;\r\n  overflow: hidden;\r\n  clip: rect(0 0 0 0);\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n@media (min-width: 801px) {\r\n  .handover-rounds__list {\r\n    position: sticky;\r\n    top: 16px;\r\n  }\r\n  .handover-rounds__roster {\r\n    max-height: max(240px, calc(100dvh - 350px));\r\n    overflow-y: auto;\r\n    padding: 2px;\r\n    scrollbar-gutter: stable;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n@media (max-width: 1023px) and (min-width: 801px) {\r\n  .handover-rounds__layout {\r\n    grid-template-columns: 240px minmax(0, 1fr);\r\n    gap: 16px;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n@media (max-width: 800px) {\r\n  .handover-rounds__layout {\r\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);\r\n    gap: 20px;\r\n  }\r\n  .handover-rounds__filters {\r\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n  }\r\n  .handover-rounds__roster {\r\n    max-height: 230px;\r\n    overflow-y: auto;\r\n    padding: 2px;\r\n  }\r\n  .handover-rounds__patient-heading {\r\n    padding: 14px;\r\n  }\r\n  .handover-rounds__patient-heading .patient-identity .patient-identity__name {\r\n    font-size: 18px;\r\n  }\r\n  .handover-rounds__patient-heading > a:not(#ds) {\r\n    font-size: 12px;\r\n  }\r\n  .handover-rounds__composer {\r\n    padding: 16px;\r\n  }\r\n  .handover-rounds__history .cts__body,\r\n  .handover-rounds__history .diario-card {\r\n    padding: 12px;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n@media (max-width: 440px) {\r\n  .handover-rounds__patient-heading {\r\n    align-items: flex-start;\r\n    flex-direction: column;\r\n  }\r\n  .handover-rounds__tabs {\r\n    padding-inline: 10px;\r\n    gap: 4px;\r\n  }\r\n  .handover-rounds__tabs button {\r\n    font-size: 13px;\r\n    gap: 5px;\r\n  }\r\n  .handover-rounds__history .diario-history-filters label {\r\n    flex: 1 1 110px;\r\n    min-width: 0;\r\n  }\r\n  .handover-rounds__history .diario-history-filters input {\r\n    width: 100%;\r\n    max-width: 100%;\r\n  }\r\n  .handover-rounds__actions {\r\n    gap: 8px;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"],["STYLE",{},".assessment-catalog { display: grid; gap: 18px; --ds-control-h: 44px; }\r\n/* Keep the catalog on the same left axis as the patient TopNav. */\r\n@media screen { .assessment-catalog { margin-inline: 24px; } }\r\n@media screen and (max-width: 900px) { .assessment-catalog { margin-inline: 16px; } }\r\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px) { .assessment-catalog { margin-inline: 12px; } }\r\n.assessment-catalog h2, .assessment-catalog h3, .assessment-catalog h4, .assessment-catalog p { margin: 0; }\r\n.assessment-catalog h3 { margin-bottom: 10px; }\r\n.assessment-catalog-list { display: grid; gap: 8px; }\r\n.assessment-catalog-row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #d8e0e8); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--surface, #fff); }\r\n.assessment-catalog-row > div:first-child { min-width: 0; display: grid; gap: 5px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\r\n.assessment-catalog-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px; max-width: 100%; }\r\n.assessment-catalog-purpose { color: var(--text-secondary, #526170); font-size: .9rem; }\r\n.assessment-catalog-action { white-space: normal; }\r\n.assessment-catalog-action:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--primary, #2563eb); outline-offset: 3px; }\r\n.assessment-catalog-secondary { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--text-muted, #526170); }\r\n.patient-module-return { align-self: flex-start; width: fit-content; max-width: 100%; margin-bottom: 12px; }\r\n.nrs-legacy { display: grid; gap: 12px; }\r\n.nrs-legacy details { padding: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #d8e0e8); border-radius: 8px; }\r\n.nrs-legacy summary { cursor: pointer; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\r\n.nrs-legacy pre { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font: inherit; }\r\n.nrs-legacy dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }\r\n.nrs-legacy dd { margin: 4px 0 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\r\n.nrs-legacy-note { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\r\n.nrs-print-surface { display: none; }\r\n.assessment-catalog-icon { width:40px; height:40px; min-width:40px; min-height:40px; padding:0; display:grid; place-items:center; font-size:24px; }\r\n.assessment-draft-chip { padding:2px 8px; border-radius:20px; width:fit-content; background:var(--amber-bg,#fdf3e2); color:#8a5300; font-size:12px; }\r\n@media (max-width: 900px) { .assessment-catalog-row { align-items:flex-start; flex-direction:column; } .assessment-catalog-actions { display:flex; } }\r\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\r\n  .assessment-catalog > button, .assessment-catalog .assessment-catalog-actions button, .patient-module-return {\r\n    min-width: 44px;\r\n    min-height: 44px;\r\n    max-width: 100%;\r\n    white-space: normal;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n@media print {\r\n  .nrs-legacy .no-print { display: none !important; }\r\n  body[data-nrs-print] > *:not(.nrs-print-surface) { display: none !important; }\r\n  body[data-nrs-print] > .nrs-print-surface { display: block !important; padding: 12mm; }\r\n  .nrs-legacy details { break-inside: avoid; }\r\n}\r\n"],["STYLE",{},"/* Navigazione condivisa (un solo componente). Nella cartella paziente è una barra unica di sezioni\r\n   (level2 + top-nav--section-grid, con etichette di gruppo); level3 resta per le sotto-navigazioni\r\n   interne di altre pagine (es. Terapia Farmacologica). */\r\n\r\n.top-nav {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  margin-inline: 24px;\r\n  box-sizing: border-box;\r\n  font-family: inherit;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav__context-label {\r\n  flex: 0 0 auto;\r\n  min-width: max-content;\r\n  padding-right: 14px;\r\n  border-right: 1px solid var(--border, #d8e0ea);\r\n  color: #52667d;\r\n  font-size: 11px;\r\n  font-weight: 800;\r\n  line-height: 1.2;\r\n  letter-spacing: 0.07em;\r\n  text-transform: uppercase;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav__items {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 6px;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  overflow-x: auto;\r\n  overscroll-behavior-inline: contain;\r\n  scrollbar-width: thin;\r\n  scrollbar-color: #c2cedd transparent;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav__item {\r\n  position: relative;\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  flex: 0 0 auto;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: center;\r\n  gap: 7px;\r\n  min-height: 44px;\r\n  padding: 9px 14px;\r\n  border: 1px solid transparent;\r\n  border-radius: 8px;\r\n  color: #40546b;\r\n  background: transparent;\r\n  font: inherit;\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n  cursor: pointer;\r\n  transition:\r\n    color 0.15s ease-out,\r\n    background 0.15s ease-out,\r\n    border-color 0.15s ease-out,\r\n    box-shadow 0.15s ease-out;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav__item:hover {\r\n  color: #17345f;\r\n  background: #edf3fb;\r\n  border-color: #d4dfed;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav__item:focus-visible {\r\n  outline: 3px solid rgba(47, 107, 237, 0.3);\r\n  outline-offset: 2px;\r\n  z-index: 1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* L2 — strong, stable primary tab rail. */\r\n.top-nav--level2 {\r\n  min-height: 58px;\r\n  margin-top: 12px;\r\n  padding: 7px 9px;\r\n  border: 1px solid #d8e0ea;\r\n  border-radius: 12px;\r\n  background: var(--surface, #fff);\r\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(16, 32, 54, 0.07);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav--level2 .top-nav__item.is-active {\r\n  color: #fff;\r\n  background: #1f5bd8;\r\n  border-color: #1f5bd8;\r\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(31, 91, 216, 0.25);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* L3 — flat contextual navigation, visibly subordinate to L2. */\r\n.top-nav--level3 {\r\n  min-height: 50px;\r\n  margin-top: 6px;\r\n  padding-inline: 10px;\r\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #dbe3ed;\r\n  background: transparent;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav--level3 .top-nav__items {\r\n  gap: 15px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav--level3 .top-nav__item {\r\n  min-height: 44px;\r\n  padding: 8px 2px 7px;\r\n  border: 0;\r\n  border-radius: 0;\r\n  color: #52667d;\r\n  background: transparent;\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n  font-weight: 650;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav--level3 .top-nav__item::after {\r\n  content: '';\r\n  position: absolute;\r\n  right: 0;\r\n  bottom: 0;\r\n  left: 0;\r\n  height: 3px;\r\n  border-radius: 999px 999px 0 0;\r\n  background: transparent;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav--level3 .top-nav__item:hover {\r\n  color: #174fae;\r\n  background: transparent;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav--level3 .top-nav__item.is-active {\r\n  color: #174fae;\r\n  font-weight: 800;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav--level3 .top-nav__item.is-active::after {\r\n  background: #2f6bed;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Patient-record section rail: content-sized tabs wrap without horizontal scrolling.\r\n   Keep destinations compact even when an area contains only a few short labels. */\r\n.top-nav--section-grid {\r\n  min-height: 52px;\r\n  margin-top: 8px;\r\n  padding: 6px 8px;\r\n  border: 1px solid #d8e0ea;\r\n  border-radius: 10px;\r\n  background: var(--surface, #fff);\r\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(16, 32, 54, 0.05);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav--section-grid .top-nav__items {\r\n  flex: 1 1 100%;\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  align-items: stretch;\r\n  gap: 4px 8px;\r\n  overflow: visible;\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav--section-grid .top-nav__item {\r\n  width: auto;\r\n  max-width: 100%;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  min-height: 44px;\r\n  padding: 8px 12px;\r\n  border-radius: 7px;\r\n  line-height: 1.25;\r\n  white-space: normal;\r\n  text-wrap: balance;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav--section-grid .top-nav__item:hover {\r\n  background: #f3f6fb;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav--section-grid .top-nav__item.is-active {\r\n  background: #eef4ff;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav--section-grid .top-nav__item::after {\r\n  right: 8px;\r\n  bottom: 2px;\r\n  left: 8px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav__badge {\r\n  min-width: 20px;\r\n  padding: 2px 6px;\r\n  border-radius: 999px;\r\n  color: #285cae;\r\n  background: #e4edfb;\r\n  font-size: 11px;\r\n  font-weight: 800;\r\n  line-height: 1.35;\r\n  text-align: center;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.top-nav--level2 .top-nav__item.is-active .top-nav__badge {\r\n  /* Sfondo scuro: contrasto ≥ 4,5:1 anche per il testo piccolo del badge (WCAG AA). */\r\n  color: #fff;\r\n  background: #143f99;\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\r\n  .top-nav {\r\n    align-items: stretch;\r\n    flex-direction: column;\r\n    gap: 5px;\r\n    margin-inline: 16px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .top-nav__context-label {\r\n    padding: 1px 2px 5px;\r\n    border-right: 0;\r\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #d8e0ea;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .top-nav__items {\r\n    padding-bottom: 2px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .top-nav--level2 {\r\n    padding: 7px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .top-nav--level3 {\r\n    padding-inline: 4px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .top-nav--section-grid {\r\n    flex-direction: row;\r\n    margin-inline: 16px;\r\n    padding: 6px;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\r\n  .top-nav {\r\n    margin-inline: 12px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .top-nav--section-grid {\r\n    margin-inline: 12px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .top-nav--level2 .top-nav__item,\r\n  .top-nav--level3 .top-nav__item {\r\n    font-size: 13px;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Etichette e separatori di gruppo nella barra a un livello della cartella: solo visivi. */\r\n.top-nav__group-label {\r\n  align-self: center;\r\n  padding: 0 2px 0 10px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted, #5a6b80);\r\n  font-size: 11px;\r\n  font-weight: 800;\r\n  letter-spacing: 0.06em;\r\n  text-transform: uppercase;\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.top-nav__group-label:first-child {\r\n  padding-left: 4px;\r\n}\r\n.top-nav__group-sep {\r\n  align-self: stretch;\r\n  width: 1px;\r\n  margin: 8px 4px;\r\n  background: var(--border, #e6ebf2);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* Barra unica della cartella (primo livello + griglia): va a capo, allineata a sinistra, etichetta\r\n   sopra e pillola blu piena per la sezione attiva. Sul telefono una riga sola che scorre dentro la\r\n   barra, così la navigazione non spinge il contenuto fuori dallo schermo. */\r\n.top-nav--level2.top-nav--section-grid {\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  align-items: flex-start;\r\n  row-gap: 4px;\r\n}\r\n.top-nav--level2.top-nav--section-grid .top-nav__context-label {\r\n  /* Sul tablet ogni riga conta: le etichette di gruppo bastano a orientarsi. */\r\n  display: none;\r\n}\r\n.top-nav--level2.top-nav--section-grid .top-nav__item {\r\n  padding: 8px 8px;\r\n}\r\n.top-nav--level2.top-nav--section-grid .top-nav__group-sep {\r\n  margin: 8px 2px;\r\n}\r\n.top-nav--level2.top-nav--section-grid .top-nav__group-label {\r\n  padding-left: 6px;\r\n}\r\n.top-nav--level2.top-nav--section-grid .top-nav__items {\r\n  gap: 4px 4px;\r\n}\r\n.top-nav--level2.top-nav--section-grid .top-nav__items {\r\n  justify-content: flex-start;\r\n}\r\n.top-nav--level2.top-nav--section-grid .top-nav__item.is-active,\r\n.top-nav--level2.top-nav--section-grid .top-nav__item.is-active:hover {\r\n  color: #fff;\r\n  background: #1f5bd8;\r\n  border-color: #1f5bd8;\r\n}\r\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\r\n  .top-nav--level2.top-nav--section-grid .top-nav__items {\r\n    flex-wrap: nowrap;\r\n    overflow-x: auto;\r\n    scrollbar-width: thin;\r\n  }\r\n  .top-nav--level2.top-nav--section-grid .top-nav__item {\r\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ── HMI 1: sezioni della cartella a chip (prototipo) ─────────────────────────\r\n   Chip 48 px, bordo 2 px, raggio 12; attiva = fondo azzurro, bordo blu, testo blu semibold.\r\n   Nessuna etichetta di contesto: le chip parlano da sole. */\r\n.top-nav--chips {\r\n  flex: 1 1 auto;\r\n  min-height: 0;\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n  border: 0;\r\n  border-radius: 0;\r\n  background: transparent;\r\n  box-shadow: none;\r\n}\r\n.top-nav--chips .top-nav__context-label {\r\n  display: none;\r\n}\r\n.top-nav--chips .top-nav__items {\r\n  gap: 8px;\r\n  overflow-x: auto;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n}\r\n.top-nav--chips .top-nav__item {\r\n  height: 48px;\r\n  min-height: 48px;\r\n  padding: 0 16px;\r\n  border: 2px solid var(--border, #e1e7f0);\r\n  border-radius: 12px;\r\n  background: var(--surface, #fff);\r\n  color: var(--text, #16202e);\r\n  font: 400 16px/24px var(--font-ui);\r\n  box-shadow: none;\r\n}\r\n.top-nav--chips .top-nav__item:hover {\r\n  background: var(--surface, #fff);\r\n  border-color: var(--blue, #2f6bed);\r\n  color: var(--text, #16202e);\r\n}\r\n.top-nav--chips .top-nav__item.is-active {\r\n  background: #eaf1fe;\r\n  border-color: var(--blue, #2f6bed);\r\n  color: #1d4fc4;\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n  box-shadow: none;\r\n}\r\n.top-nav--chips .top-nav__item.is-active .top-nav__badge {\r\n  color: #1d4fc4;\r\n  background: #fff;\r\n}\r\n.top-nav--chips .top-nav__item:focus-visible {\r\n  outline: 3px solid #245bb5;\r\n  outline-offset: 2px;\r\n}\r\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\r\n  .top-nav--chips {\r\n    flex-direction: row;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"],["STYLE",{},"/* Direct access: the item a navigation landed on (handover, diary entry, allergy table) is\r\n   outlined in medical blue for a few seconds, so the eye finds it without searching. */\r\n.chart-focus-item {\r\n  outline: 3px solid var(--blue, #2f6bed);\r\n  outline-offset: 3px;\r\n  border-radius: 10px;\r\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue, #2f6bed) 14%, transparent);\r\n  transition:\r\n    outline-color 0.4s ease,\r\n    box-shadow 0.4s ease;\r\n  scroll-margin: 96px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\r\n  .chart-focus-item {\r\n    transition: none;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"],["STYLE",{},".diagnosis-description {\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\ntextarea.diagnosis-description__input {\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n  min-height: 200px;\r\n  line-height: 1.65;\r\n  resize: vertical;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.diagnosis-preview {\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\r\n  background: var(--surface);\r\n  padding: 10px 12px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.diagnosis-preview summary {\r\n  cursor: pointer;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.diagnosis-preview[open] summary {\r\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.diagnosis-text {\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n  font-weight: 400;\r\n  line-height: 1.65;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.diagnosis-text > * {\r\n  margin: 0 0 12px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.diagnosis-text > :last-child {\r\n  margin-bottom: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.diagnosis-text h4 {\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n  line-height: inherit;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.diagnosis-text ul {\r\n  list-style: none;\r\n  padding-left: 8px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.diagnosis-text li {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  align-items: baseline;\r\n  gap: 8px;\r\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.diagnosis-text__marker {\r\n  flex-shrink: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.diagnosis-notes {\r\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  padding-top: 10px;\r\n  margin-top: 8px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.diagnosis-notes > .form-label {\r\n  display: block;\r\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.diagnosis-error {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (max-width: 480px) {\r\n  .diagnosis-item {\r\n    flex-direction: column;\r\n    align-items: stretch;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .diagnosis-item > .cr-item-row__actions {\r\n    order: -1;\r\n    align-self: flex-end;\r\n    padding-top: 0;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"],["STYLE",{},".parameter-entry-clock {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;\r\n  column-gap: 20px;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  margin: 0 0 20px;\r\n  padding: 18px 22px;\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 12px;\r\n  background: var(--surface);\r\n}\r\n.parameter-entry-clock > span {\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-entry-clock time {\r\n  grid-row: 1 / 3;\r\n  grid-column: 1;\r\n  font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 54px);\r\n  font-weight: 750;\r\n  line-height: 1.1;\r\n  color: var(--blue);\r\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-entry-clock > span:first-child {\r\n  grid-column: 2;\r\n  font-weight: 650;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n}\r\n.parameter-entry-patient {\r\n  border: 0;\r\n  background: transparent;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n  text-align: left;\r\n  font: inherit;\r\n  min-height: 44px;\r\n  white-space: normal;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-entry-patient:focus-visible {\r\n  outline: 2px solid var(--blue);\r\n  outline-offset: 3px;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-entry-patient__text {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  gap: 3px;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-entry-last {\r\n  font-size: 11px;\r\n  color: var(--blue);\r\n}\r\n.parameter-entry-result {\r\n  grid-column: 1 / -1;\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n  color: var(--text);\r\n  padding: 6px 0;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-entry-row .qe-row__note-btn svg {\r\n  width: 15px;\r\n  height: 15px;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-entry-row .qe-row__note-btn {\r\n  gap: 5px;\r\n  padding-inline: 8px;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-note-count {\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: center;\r\n  min-width: 19px;\r\n  height: 19px;\r\n  padding-inline: 4px;\r\n  border-radius: 10px;\r\n  background: var(--blue);\r\n  color: #fff;\r\n  font-size: 11px;\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-note-count--draft {\r\n  background: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.parameter-note-summary {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: space-between;\r\n  gap: 8px;\r\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-note-label {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  gap: 6px;\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-entry-help {\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n  line-height: 1.5;\r\n  margin: 16px 0;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-entry-progress {\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-history {\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-history-toolbar {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  gap: 12px;\r\n  align-items: end;\r\n  margin: 20px 0;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-history-toolbar > div {\r\n  flex: 1 1 240px;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-history-toolbar h3 {\r\n  margin: 0 0 6px;\r\n  font-size: 17px;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-history-toolbar p {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-history-toolbar label {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  gap: 5px;\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-history-error {\r\n  color: var(--red);\r\n  padding: 12px;\r\n  background: var(--surface);\r\n}\r\n.parameter-history-list {\r\n  list-style: none;\r\n  padding: 0;\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-history-day {\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n  margin: 22px 0 10px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.parameter-history-reading {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  grid-template-columns: 135px minmax(0, 1fr);\r\n  gap: 14px;\r\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  border-radius: 10px;\r\n  padding: 16px;\r\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n  background: var(--surface);\r\n}\r\n.parameter-history-stamp {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n  align-content: start;\r\n  gap: 5px;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-history-stamp time {\r\n  font-size: 24px;\r\n  color: var(--blue);\r\n  font-weight: 750;\r\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-history-stamp span {\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-history-reading dl {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  gap: 14px 24px;\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-history-reading dt {\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  margin-bottom: 5px;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-history-reading dd {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  font-size: 17px;\r\n  font-weight: 650;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-history-reading dd small {\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  font-weight: 400;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-history-note {\r\n  grid-column: 1 / -1;\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\r\n  padding-top: 12px;\r\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-month-scroll {\r\n  max-width: 100%;\r\n  overflow-x: auto;\r\n  margin-top: 16px;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-month-table {\r\n  min-width: 660px;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-month-table caption {\r\n  text-align: left;\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n  padding: 0 0 12px;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-month-table th,\r\n.parameter-month-table td {\r\n  vertical-align: top;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-month-table th[scope='row'] {\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-month-table dl {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n  gap: 6px 14px;\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-month-table dl > div {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n  gap: 5px;\r\n  white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-month-table dt {\r\n  color: var(--text-muted);\r\n}\r\n.parameter-month-table dd {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n}\r\n.parameter-mont